{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"働きマンこと新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式サイトでも発表されたように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この度、\n何度目の青空か？カフェの\nカフェマネージャーを\n勤めさせて頂くことになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/09/6449853/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"場所が丸の内ということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"丸の内でOLをしている私が\n居心地の良い空間を提供し、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更に！\n乃木坂46のことを\nよりたくさんの方に\n知って貰えるよう\nコーディネートさせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェマネージャーということで、\n店内のレイアウトや\n限定メニューなど打ち合わせで\nあれこれ注文してきたよお(⌒▽⌒)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/09/6449853/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着ける空間の中に\n乃木坂らしさをたくさん\n詰め込んだカフェです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"丸の内近辺にいつもいる人は\n是非是非寄ってみて下さいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブと丸かぶりなので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段丸の内に来ないよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って方も、この機会に是非！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、、、\n昨日はOPEN初日ということで、\nたくさんの女性が遊びに来て\nくれました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったかな、、、？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反応が気になる、、、(>_<)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブのリハ期間と\n被ってたり、\nOLの決算期が被ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バタバタしてたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"睡眠時間削りながら\n手書きの店内POPを\n作ったりしてました！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/09/6449853/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(実際に見て欲しいから\n写真粗めにしとく笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ、\nたくさんのお客さんが\n来てくれて本当に嬉しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも\n初日ということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお世話になっている\nナタリーさんなどが取材に\n来てくれたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと！\nニッポン放送の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたとハッピー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キキマス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のラジオ生放送にも出演させて\n頂いたり、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に頑張って良かった(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ1ヶ月間、\nカフェは続きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも\nカフェマネージャーとして\n何日か店頭にも立つので、\n良かったら遊びに来て下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性解禁も今しばらく\nお待ちを～(>_<)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OL\nカフェマネージャー\nアンダーライブ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部頑張るよ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/09/6449853/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目シングルも\nよろしくお願いします(｀_´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブについては\nまたの機会に更新します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、13公演。\n少しずつでも成長したいっっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n今日はこの辺で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/09/6449853/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/09/6449853/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}